                </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="text-xs text-outline font-label-code">今天 08:35</span>
<button class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest hover:bg-secondary-container text-on-surface border border-outline-variant/40 font-label-md text-label-md font-medium transition-colors">
                错因解析
              </button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Activity Record 2: 记 -->
<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low/40 hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors duration-150 border border-outline-variant/20 flex items-center justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-tertiary-container/30 flex items-center justify-center text-tertiary flex-shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" data-icon="style">style</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-0.5">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="font-headline-sm text-base text-on-surface font-semibold">《高考核心英语词汇 List 14》</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-secondary-fixed text-on-secondary-fixed font-semibold font-label-code">艾宾浩斯第 3 节点达标</span>
<span class="text-xs text-secondary font-label-code">巩固 24 词</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">
                  包含 ambiguous、preliminary 等易混淆长难词，已顺利固化进长效记忆库。
                </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="text-xs text-outline font-label-code">昨天 21:10</span>
<button class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest hover:bg-secondary-container text-on-surface border border-outline-variant/40 font-label-md text-label-md font-medium transition-colors">
                回顾卡片
              </button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Activity Record 3: 学 -->
<div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low/40 hover:bg-surface-container-low transition-colors duration-150 border border-outline-variant/20 flex items-center justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-4">
<div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-secondary-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary flex-shrink-0">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[20px]" data-icon="auto_stories">auto_stories</span>
</div>
<div class="space-y-0.5">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="font-headline-sm text-base text-on-surface font-semibold">《近代史纲要脉络全景图》思维导图</span>
<span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed-variant font-semibold font-label-code">精读完成</span>
<span class="text-xs text-secondary font-label-code">5 个考点已归档</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-secondary">
                  AI 伴学自动补充了洋务运动与戊戌维新的对比结构表，已同步至「知识库-历史专题」。
                </p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<span class="text-xs text-outline font-label-code">昨天 19:40</span>
<button class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-surface-container-lowest hover:bg-secondary-container text-on-surface border border-outline-variant/40 font-label-md text-label-md font-medium transition-colors">
                查看导图
              </button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
</div>
</main>
